  "_comment": "Permanent seed: the committed Socrata NCHS Natality baseline for 1960-2002, recovered from git history (commit 41ce68e) after build-snapshots.js silently dropped it in commit 3f2f733 (2026-09-13). Root cause: buildNatality() used to treat the OUTPUT directory's existing natality.json as its own \"baseline\" input, which only works if that exact outDir already had the 1960-2002 rows merged in from a prior run — a self-referential design that silently produces 2003-only data forever, the moment it is ever run against a fresh or different outDir. This file is now the single fixed source of truth for the pre-2003 years; build-snapshots.js reads it directly instead of its own last output. Do not regenerate this file from a pipeline run — there is no live source for 1960-2002 to regenerate it FROM; if it is ever lost again, recover it from git history the same way.",
